   {
    "primary": {
     "type": "TextChapter",
     "page_section_element_title": [],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Card is a visual convention of grouping and displaying information together, making it visually pleasing and easy to scan. Use cards for a single topic, do not mix information in them.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Use Card when the user is expected to navigate to another page. The entire module is clickable, supporting a seamless and intuitive interaction. Cards are typically used in sets to surface relevant destinations or entry points on a page. See Card Collection and Card Strip for layout options.",
       "spans": [
        {
         "start": 242,
         "end": 257,
         "type": "hyperlink",
         "data": {
          "id": "ZEZxDRQAACUAsgG7",
          "type": "design_system_content",
          "tags": [],
          "lang": "en-eu",
          "slug": "card-collection",
          "first_publication_date": "2023-04-24T12:08:05+0000",
          "last_publication_date": "2024-08-16T10:23:01+0000",
          "uid": "_ds_sections_card-collection",
          "link_type": "Document",
          "isBroken": false
         }
        },
        {
         "start": 262,
         "end": 272,
         "type": "hyperlink",
         "data": {
          "id": "Z8jEURAAACEAcXCq",
          "type": "design_system_content",
          "tags": [],
          "lang": "en-eu",
          "slug": "card-strip",
          "first_publication_date": "2025-03-05T21:39:54+0000",
          "last_publication_date": "2025-03-05T22:06:11+0000",
          "uid": "_ds_sections_card-strip",
          "link_type": "Document",
          "isBroken": false
         }
        }
       ],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "If the action is not navigation, but something else such as downloading a file, use the Liftup module instead. If no interaction is needed, consider using the Content Box or Image Tile depending on the content type. \n\nCards are intended for concise content. If you need to present more detailed information, consider using e.g. a Text and Image section instead.",
